const items=[{q:"When do hot air balloons fly in Cappadocia?",a:["Hot air balloons in Cappadocia typically operate two main flight sessions each morning around sunrise. Hotel pickup generally occurs about one hour before the first flight, and the exact pickup time is shared one day before according to weather, wind direction and hotel location."]},{q:"How high do hot air balloons fly in Cappadocia?",a:["Hot air balloons can rise up to a maximum of 8,000 ft (2,400 m), depending on wind and weather conditions."]},{q:"How safe is hot air ballooning with CappadociaGo?",a:["Hot air ballooning is strictly regulated in Turkey by the Civil Aviation Authority (SHGM). Flights operate only under suitable conditions and certified operators follow required safety procedures."]},{q:"Are hot air balloons insured?",a:["Yes. Balloon operators in Turkey are legally required to carry comprehensive insurance, and passenger insurance is included in the ticket price."]},{q:"What if my flight gets canceled due to bad weather?",a:["If a flight is canceled due to unsafe weather, we provide a full refund or, subject to availability, can check a suitable alternative date."]},{q:"Can I change my flight date?",a:["Yes. You can request a date change subject to seat availability. Seasonal price differences or a reissue fee may apply."]},{q:"Where exactly do we fly from and through?",a:["The take-off point is selected according to the morning wind. Typical routes may pass over Göreme, Paşabağ, Çavuşin, Rose Valley, Love Valley, Swords Valley and Kızılçukur Valley."]},{q:"Do I need to pay a cancellation fee for voluntary cancellations?",a:["Voluntary cancellation conditions depend on the notice period. Please review the Distance Sales Agreement for applicable timelines and deductions."]},{q:"Can I update my hotel pick-up location later?",a:["Yes. Contact our support team before your flight to update your pickup location if the new address is within our standard Cappadocia service area."]},{q:"What are the other daily tours and activities offered?",a:["We offer Red, Green and Blue Tours, ATV and Jeep Safari, horse riding, Turkish Night, cultural activities, and airport/private transfer services."]},{q:"What are the important safety rules before the flight?",a:["Listen carefully to the pilot’s safety briefing and follow all instructions, especially the correct landing position before touchdown."]}];
